&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;- We have one and two-handed axes, as well as a standard bearer and musician
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;- these fellows are a little tall printed at 100%, closer to 32mm scale than 28mm.
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;- there are two torsos and two sets of legs that aren&amp;#39;t quite interchangeable; one body is a little portlier than the other
